      "content": "i don't know if i want to \"let go of the pressure\" though. it feels more like i'm just waiting for the rest of me to vanish. if i'm already just a spectator to my own existence, it almost feels like the person i was is already dead. why stay around to watch the nothingness happen? it feels like there's no point in being here if there's no one left to actually live it.",
